1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,730
If you freeze this frog,

2
00:00:01,770 --> 00:00:03,920
its HEART completely STOPS!

3
00:00:03,960 --> 00:00:05,660
Ice spreads through its body,

4
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:06,950
it stops breathing,

5
00:00:06,990 --> 00:00:08,760
and it looks completely dead.

6
00:00:08,800 --> 00:00:09,885
But its liver releases

7
00:00:09,925 --> 00:00:11,550
massive amounts of sugar,

8
00:00:11,590 --> 00:00:12,475
protecting its cells

9
00:00:12,515 --> 00:00:14,590
while the rest of its body freezes!

10
00:00:14,630 --> 00:00:16,740
It can survive like this for weeks!

11
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:18,050
And when spring arrives,

12
00:00:18,090 --> 00:00:19,170
the ice melts,

13
00:00:19,210 --> 00:00:20,940
its heart starts beating again…

14
00:00:20,980 --> 00:00:22,105
And it just HOPS AWAY

15
00:00:22,145 --> 00:00:23,380
like nothing happened!

